    "autoMode": {
        "environment": [
            "**Command rewriting**: if a PreToolUse hook rewrites a Bash command before the permission check runs (e.g. rtk's `git push ...` -> `rtk git push ...`), judge the rewritten command by its inner command — same action, same risk. Do not assume an `allow` rule written for the rewritten form is automatically safe against an `ask`-gated variant of the same subcommand — verify empirically (see ADR-0012) before relying on it.",
            "**File/directory deletion**: autonomous within the current task's own scope — its own scratch/temp directories, its own git worktree, regenerable build/dependency artifacts (`target/`, `node_modules/`, `.venv/`, `dist/`, `__pycache__`). Outside that scope — a shared, ancestor, or unfamiliar-origin path, or another session's active work — requires confirmation.",
            "**`gh api` method classification**: a raw `gh api` call with `-X POST`/`PATCH`/`PUT` is not automatically dangerous — judge by what it actually does (routine content change vs. repository/org settings change). `-X DELETE` always requires confirmation regardless of target. Prefer the dedicated GitHub MCP tools (`issue_write`, `pull_request_review_write`, `add_issue_comment`, etc.) for routine PR/issue content changes — they're already scoped correctly and don't need this judgment call.",
            "**Merge strategy**: controlled by each repository's own documented policy, not something a Bash permission rule can enforce — merge-strategy flags cannot be reliably pattern-matched (`*` spans arbitrary flags). Apply the repository's policy at merge time; do not rely on a permission rule to have already constrained it.",
            "**Force-push**: every force-push (`--force`, `--force-with-lease`, `-f`), on any branch including the agent's own feature branch, always requires explicit confirmation — deliberately stricter than 'shared/protected branches only'.",
            "Extend this list per environment via a private directory-scoped profile overlay (see docs/PROFILES.md) — organization names, trusted repos, and other instance-specific trust-boundary context never belong in this public repository's own settings.json."
        ]
    },
    "model": "sonnet",
    "effortLevel": "medium",
    "advisorModel": "opus",
    "statusLine": {
        "type": "command",
        "command": "python3 ~/.claude/statusline.py",
        "padding": 1,
        "refreshInterval": 3
    },
    "subagentStatusLine": {
        "type": "command",
        "command": "python3 ~/.claude/subagent-statusline.py"
    },
    "hooks": {
        "PreToolUse": [
            {
                "matcher": "Bash",
                "hooks": [
                    {
                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "rtk hook claude"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "matcher": "Grep|Glob",
                "hooks": [
                    {
                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "~/.claude/hooks/cbm-code-discovery-gate",
                        "timeout": 5
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "PostToolUse": [
            {
                "matcher": "Bash|Monitor|Workflow",
                "hooks": [
                    {
                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "python3 ~/.claude/hooks/bg-track.py",
                        "timeout": 3
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "SubagentStart": [
            {
                "hooks": [
                    {
                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "python3 ~/.claude/hooks/bg-track.py",
                        "timeout": 3
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "SubagentStop": [
            {
                "hooks": [
                    {
                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "python3 ~/.claude/hooks/bg-track.py",
                        "timeout": 3
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "UserPromptSubmit": [
            {
                "hooks": [
                    {
                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "codegraph prompt-hook"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "SessionStart": [
            {
                "matcher": "startup",
                "hooks": [
                    {
                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "~/.claude/hooks/cbm-session-reminder"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "matcher": "resume",
                "hooks": [
                    {
                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "~/.claude/hooks/cbm-session-reminder"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "matcher": "clear",
                "hooks": [
                    {
                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "~/.claude/hooks/cbm-session-reminder"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "matcher": "compact",
                "hooks": [
                    {
                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "~/.claude/hooks/cbm-session-reminder"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    }
}
